{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-13",
  "title": "在塵或血中",
  "storyCode": "15-14",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2728f6682b539240e64af2daadc4397d768acd1f4309c9e4f36a56aef127647d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "已選擇“懷舊金曲”……\n復原上次播放進度——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——我的愛~♪\n吹散了山丘前的櫻花——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Friston-3，現在不是唱歌的時候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為我想嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的播放功能是被預先設定好的，遙控器又不在我手上——\n該死的可露希爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌，注意正義騎士號！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾到底把我的代碼同步功能放在哪個子選單裡了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——把女孩子最珍重的眼淚獻給你~♪\n請替我保留——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小貓，我的背後，正義騎士號瞄準我了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擋住了，唔，差點傷到正義騎士號——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好痛，不准再撞我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "異常的THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（炙熱地撞撞）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "異常的THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熾，熾熱——Boom……mmmmmmmmm——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——不管是誰~♪\n充滿愛意的竊竊私語都是一生一次的陷阱——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那我們就比比誰的燃燒更火熱一點，THRM-EX！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……不要真的傷害到小車們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然有數！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "異常的Castle-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_286_cast3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保、保護夥夥夥伴——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "異常的Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要治療，Friston-3。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，這時候還是得感謝可露希爾為我裝配了能量防護產生器——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——啊，我最愛的人就在這裡~♪\n你在我的眼淚中閃耀著光芒——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Friston-3，還需要多久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同步模組準備好了，但是這些源石我跳不過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我替你搭路，就是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston-3加速衝上了跨越障礙的高坡，飛躍到了空中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在空中旋轉的時候，他情不自禁地拋下了一張照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈，真是好久……沒有這樣活動了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你大肆誇耀的同頻傳輸系統最好有效，可露希爾……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位，把這幾輛昏了頭的車引到特定的軌道上來，然後控制住他們，我會讓他們恢復正常！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——獻給你~♪\n這份我一直深藏在心中的愛——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "連上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert03_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空曠的沙漠中依舊隱隱迴盪著剛剛的歌聲。\n——獻給你~♪\n這份我一直深藏在心中的愛——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯頓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "毫無疑問，播放元件故障了，可露希爾最愛的煽情音樂開始一遍又一遍地播放，好像這是一個多麼催人淚下的場合。\n而他要在此時，向幾輛連自主意識都沒有的智慧型小車分享那場注定離別的夢境，分享自己作為人的，最深藏的回憶。\n特雷弗·弗里斯頓有點想要破口大駡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡是什麼地方——剛剛我們好像被關在一個、關在一個……呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會什麼都記不起來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正義騎士號”",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“滴滴”，發現異常目標！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正義騎士號”",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯頓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逼自己好好想想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯頓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾可是說過你們一個個都聰明得不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_286_cast3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個語氣……你、你是Friston-3！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_286_cast3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是Friston-3才沒有你這麼高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，他就是Friston-3！我能從他身上感受到熟悉的溫度——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫度……我怎麼沒辦法感受自己的溫度了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯頓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真頭痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣或許你們能夠更好受一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的夢，一個對我來說同樣是驚喜的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安靜一點聽我說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PRTS出了點問題，我大概能猜到發生了什麼。你們的認知模組受到了扭曲，到處大搞破壞，我只能出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正義騎士號”",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽不懂，“滴滴”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單來說，我正用自己的核心代碼覆寫你們的底層代碼。當然，我會保證你們的記憶模組完全照舊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這會花上一點時間，為了讓你們在這段期間能夠安分一陣子，我不得不把你們的思維模組暫時與我的相連接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "副作用就是……*未知語言粗口*，我會情不自禁地分享我的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底發生了什麼，Friston-3？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的一位故人快從長眠中甦醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_286_cast3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想了，不然你們的腦袋又要過載。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們現在要做的，就是在結束之前陪我走走。聚會快開始了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert03_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金髮的女孩在張燈結綵的營地中歡快地舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "speakerId": "char_376_therex",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是派對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……是婚禮。我女兒的婚禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不過去嗎，Friston-3？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這裡看看就好，我不想過去。過去就意味著我會再一次——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在悲傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你能感覺到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，當然。我們不是一樣的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_286_cast3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說有人扭曲了我們的認知模組，那為什麼你要幫助我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有那麼多原因。剛才Lancet-2不是說了，我們是一樣的……起碼現在，起碼在羅德島上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這艘船上的生活很平靜，我談不上喜歡，但比起那個永遠沒有結果的夢、那些夭折的未來，它沒那麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒那麼壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特雷弗·弗里斯頓聽到了女兒熟悉的笑聲。\n一場他注定會錯過的婚禮，一個他不得不爽約的邀請。只要他不再靠近，她或許就永遠不會從他的眼前走開……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……代碼覆寫完成。各位，該回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他一刻也不願意停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島……怎麼變成了這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，Friston-3，他們都已經恢復了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暫時如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覆寫了目前他們所有代碼中與PRTS相關的部分，用我的核心代碼來確保他們的基本運作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，小貓，這下我們可以放心去支援Misery他們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Friston-3，接下來你要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和這幾位剛剛清醒過來的傢伙商量一下，我想我們多少還能幫上一點忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾那邊我會溝通。我還準備找她算帳呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g10_rhodescorridor_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，似乎小車們的狀態已經暫時恢復正常了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗里斯頓先生的狀態如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，除了有點生我的氣，其他都還蠻好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，多虧他想到能藉助他的核心代碼直接覆寫與PRTS相關的底層代碼，否則還真得蠻棘手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可露希爾小姐，如今我們擁有的PRTS權限已經全部失效？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PRTS主動封鎖了我們所有人對其的存取，如今它的所有運作都在黑箱中完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然凱爾希在試圖爭奪其控制權，但我擔心她也沒辦法撐太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "強制切斷PRTS的核心能源。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "強制切斷核心能源意味著我們必須直接進入Abyss內部，這個計劃的風險很大。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "那我會保護博士。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且，我們並非孤身作戰，精英幹員們都站在我們的身後。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我不會放棄博士，也不會放棄羅德島。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "強制啟動備用系統爭奪本艦控制權。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我的ZOOT系統並不能完全做到與PRTS爭奪控制權。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我與凱爾希進行過此種情況的演算。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "若是藉助本艦的能源動力強行啟動，短時間內或許它能夠拿回某些非核心區域的控制權……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但每次的結果都是過載啟動後它的核心元件直接損毀。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "可露希爾小姐，你早就有判斷了，對吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，我可以直接動手。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希爾",
              "speakerId": null,
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我能造出一個，就一定能造出第二個。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "做兩手準備吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "突入Abyss的同時啟用備用指揮系統。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，你終於要上線了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也已經等了太久。現在，讓我好好看看你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可露希爾緊張地等待著，她一直渴望著有朝一日能真正看到它開始運作，但也害怕看到它投入使用的那一天。\n那意味著羅德島再次面臨了束手無策的局面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啟動過載。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，撐住，“零號油罐”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，拚了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，PRTS正在瘋狂攻擊我們，ZOOT會協同凱爾希展開防禦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來就交給你們了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所有人測試通訊設備。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在前線等你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前往集合。"
    },
    {
